><strong>Leaderboards &amp; Achievements</strong> – Compete for the top spot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Trading Cards</strong> – Earn emoticons &amp; profile wallpapers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Cloud Support</strong> – Pick up where you left off.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Languages</strong> – Available in English, Russian, German, Italian, Portuguese, French, Simplified Chinese, and Spanish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Soundtrack by Spiff Tune</strong> – Unique chiptunes for each ship (free DLC).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by the Best: </strong>Classic hits like <strong>Luftrausers, Asteroids, Space Invaders, Galaxian,</strong> and <strong>Geometry Wars</strong> influence <strong>Bit Blaster XL</strong>’s addictive gameplay and retro charm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/433950/extras/af15f1c837a8edc3e7adb90689e8980d.apng?t=1745903625\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/433950/extras/af15f1c837a8edc3e7adb90689e8980d.poster.avif?t=1745903625\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=41 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bit Blaster XL</strong> is a simple, replayable score-chaser designed for arcade fun. If you find an issue or just want to say hi, reach out via Discord or my website, I appreciate your feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for playing!<br><strong>Adam Nickerson - Adamvision Studios</strong></p>", "short_description": "Bit Blaster XL is a fast-paced, retro arcade shoot 'em up (shmup) inspired by the classic quarter-munchers of the ‘80s. Easy to pick up, hard to put down, boost, dodge, shoot, and chase high scores in this addictive, old-school action game!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Span