f these bit blaster xl sound effects by making stupid noises with my mouth into a pretty low rent consumer microphone, so I recommend not having a sound card, or you may realize this.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> When you do things right, people won't be sure you've done anything at all.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.5+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512MB at least and nothing over... let's say, five years old<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Most 32-bit and 64-bit Linux OS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512MB +at least and nothing over... let's say, five years old<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["Adamvision Studios"], "publishers": ["Adamvision Studios"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 199, "final": 199, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$1.99"}, "packages": [433845], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Bit Blaster XL", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 433845, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Bit Blaster XL - $1.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 199}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": true, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "descr